WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.930
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.930
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:37.280
I'm Kurata Sana, 1st year Junior
high school student.

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:40.200
Manager and driver, Rei-kun.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:43.700
Aoki Award winning Mama and
squirrel Maro-chan.

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:47.170
My best friend I met in the
bathroom, Fuka.

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.290
The mysterious white bat, Babbit.

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:51.630
Christmas presents are welcome!

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:54.670
He who was having a
delicious life in New York.

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:58.050
He's now my important partner, Naozumi-kun, but...

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:01.100
Hayama Akito,
my best friend I think...

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:04.390
Now he's going out with Fuka.
Nevertheless...

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:10.310
I don't think that it's kindness
to be nice to a person that you don't like.

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:13.480
Do you remember saying that
before?

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:18.910
I like you because you're that
kind of a person.

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:22.910
So, please don't be nice to
me anymore.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:26.000
Hayama-kun was called the devil,

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:27.830
that's why you couldn't
say the line.

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:31.790
When I heard that I really
understood your feelings.

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:34.550
That you still love Hayama-kun.

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:36.170
Naozumi-kun...

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:39.300
I think we should break up.

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:44.350
Hallelujah on Christmas
Eve? My Heart...

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:47.480
I can't believe this.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:53.270
Why... why did Naozumi-kun
do that yesterday?

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:56.690
I don't get it!

00:02:56.690 --> 00:02:57.570
Um...

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:00.780
What are you doing here,
Suzuki-sensei?

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:04.200
Why? Well, I think it's because
here is the classroom.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:07.290
We're supposed to be taking
a makeup test.

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:10.870
Sana-chan was involved in
scandal.

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:13.250
Hayama was suspended.

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:15.340
Fuka-chan was in the hospital.

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:18.260
Everyone is taking the makeup test
together.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:22.180
Oh I see, I see,
I wasn't paying attention!

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:23.550
Unbelievable.

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:26.220
Sana, take it seriously.

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:28.770
Please accept my apology.

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:31.350
It's ok, I understand.

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:37.440
Alright! I have to be really serious, huh...

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:46.370
What is this really?
This seems to be all gibberish to me.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:49.500
This one is sweating.
This one is having no problem.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:55.040
If you don't do this well now, the
future's gonna be hard for you.

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:56.630
I know.

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:02.840
What's up with Hayama?

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:05.430
Aren't you gonna walk home with
him, Fuka?

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:07.390
We broke up.

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.600
Broke up...?

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:16.230
Fuka... that's...

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:18.650
...a 'joudan' (joke) right?

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:19.860
It's not a 'joudan' (joke).

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:23.110
Haha then that was a 'joke', right?

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:24.780
A 'joudan' and a 'joke' are the
same thing.

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:27.450
If it's not a 'joudan', and it's
not a 'joke' then...

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:29.660
So are you guys fighting
right now?

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:32.250
I guess the more you fight,
the more you guys get along.

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:35.330
She's saying a phrase that will
make one angry.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:38.460
No! Why don't you get it?!

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.550
I can't believe
you really don't get it!

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:45.430
It's over! We're not going out
anymore.

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:51.890
You moron.

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:54.560
Damn! Whose fault does she think
it is?

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.480
I'm so pissed off.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:03.150
I don't get this at all.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:08.870
Naozumi-kun dumped me.

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:11.240
Fuka's acting strange.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:16.460
Sana-chan, is this year's Christmas Eve going to be the same?

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:17.460
What?

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:19.630
Come on now, middle birthday.

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:23.710
I'm not having it this year.

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:25.220
I see.

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:28.390
Is it because you're going with
Naozumi-kun to the Kamura school?

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:30.890
Not exactly...

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:34.680
Something happened yesterday,
didn't it?

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:38.270
Tell me what happened between you
and Naozumi-kun.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:40.400
No... thing.

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:43.610
I heard it's really popular in
catalog shopping.

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:47.990
Look here, you're gonna tell me
everything, tell me everything.

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:50.830
Actually yesterday...

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:52.660
You're too simple, Sana!

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:56.460
Oh? So Naozumi-kun said that
he'll love you forever,

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:58.120
but will never see you again.

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:00.960
I feel like a worm inside
a mouse ear.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.960
No, it's water in the ear.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:08.430
I don't know why Naozumi-kun said
that kind of thing so suddenly.

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:10.970
I've been fooled!

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:12.760
You dense daughter!

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:16.020
Naozumi-kun is a very good
friend.

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:19.520
He doesn't deserve you. So much
that my belly-button is falling.

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:24.230
She said,
'Why do you hit me so much? '

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:28.150
Be quiet! You're denseness
deserves 100 whacks.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:29.740
I'm sorry, Naozumi-kun,

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:33.240
because my daughter is so dense,
she gave you a hard time.

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:37.080
When she grows up, I'm sure
she'll understand your feelings.

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:39.620
And she will cry with sensation.

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:43.130
- Enough already!
- No, 50 more!

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:45.840
So in conclusion,
this year's Christmas Eve

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:48.090
is a home party?

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:52.600
I think it's alright. This year,
Asako has to work again.

00:06:52.600 --> 00:06:56.180
Yeah, Mayumi, my girlfriend,
has to too.

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:57.930
Oh, really?

00:06:57.930 --> 00:06:59.850
We're having such a painful time!

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:03.650
What is this? Adults crying just
because it's Christmas?

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:05.360
Why, why?

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:07.070
What is this, what is this?

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:10.530
Am I bad or something?
I don't understand!

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:13.240
I know, in this case...

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:15.950
Put your troubles on paper!

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:19.960
Me and Naozumi-kun
were a fresh couple.

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:23.420
But... I was dumped by him.

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:28.300
Hayama and Fuka were going out

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:31.090
but broke up...?

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:33.340
So me and Hayama...

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:40.310
Your feelings are that you still
love Hayama-kun.

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:42.850
Could it possibly be...

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:46.440
...that I really still do love
Hayama?

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:50.240
Maybe it's possible...

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:56.700
when I was in New York with Naozumi-kun,
I thought I had forgotten Hayama completely.

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:59.870
But I really still feel love
for Hayama.

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:09.210
But, I suppose that my feelings
for Naozumi-kun were love too.

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:14.800
When I was in New York, I had the
feeling of wanting to protect him.

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:19.810
But then I was dumped!

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:22.640
So, the conclusion is...

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:27.650
I had a good relationship!

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:33.400
But I still have this feeling...

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:41.250
Alright! It's time to study!

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:45.540
If I get held back it'll be
embarrassing.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.710
I haven't used this desk
for such a long time.

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:54.470
There should be a limit to how
long you don't use something.

00:08:57.430 --> 00:09:00.510
Umm... Textbook... Where is it?

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:03.930
Where? Where? Where is the
textbook?

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:06.230
You have to look that hard to find
a textbook?

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:07.900
Found it.

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:12.610
What's that?

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:14.280
That's...

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:27.290
It was one year ago. There were so
many things that happened.

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:29.750
Only one year really went by?

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:33.130
It seems so long ago.

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:36.130
- Good morning!
- Good morning!

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:41.310
Mom said that cake should be from
the Africa Maemae Cafe in front of station.

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:42.850
I agree!

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:47.770
So we should go to mass at church.
And afterwards, we'll go to your house.

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:49.360
Ok.

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:52.650
You guys seem to be having
a fun morning.

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:56.240
Sana-chan, you didn't do
a lot of your homework.

00:09:56.990 --> 00:10:00.160
Sana-chan! Hey, do you want to come
with us for Christmas?

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:03.910
This year I'm having a party at my
house with my family.

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:09.670
I guess Sana-chan can't.

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:12.670
This year I'm eating cake with
my family

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:14.880
since it's my birthday that day.

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:16.840
I see.

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:19.720
Eve?

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:22.140
Yeah, like last year.

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:26.180
Don't call me for such a thing
like that when I'm training.

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:28.390
Then I guess that's a no.

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:31.270
I guess it can't be helped...
it's just the two of us then.

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:35.320
But I don't mind if it's just you
and me.

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:37.650
Oh no, Tsuyoshi-kun, you!

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:41.490
Sorry to interrupt you but...

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:43.780
You guys are having a party on
Christmas Eve?

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:45.950
- Can I join?
- Me too, me too!

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:48.080
- Sae-chan!
- Gomi-kun too!

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:51.130
Yeah, on Christmas Eve I want to
have a lot of fun!

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:54.840
I'm glad. I thought that it
would be so sad to all be separated.

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:57.550
Yeah... last year was so much fun.

00:10:57.550 --> 00:10:59.590
Really! It was fun!

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:01.430
Yeah.

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:05.220
In one year,
we had so much stuff happen.

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:09.440
I wonder if a lot of things will
happen again and if everyone will change.

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:12.730
I don't want that to happen!
I don't want to change!

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:16.110
So you're free on Christmas Eve,
Akito?

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:19.320
Yeah, I'm not really doing
anything.

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:23.410
Really? Well, Dad wanted to do something
along with having the Santa costume.

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:27.330
I wanted to sing and dance with
you guys. And presents too!

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:29.120
I'm so glad that I borrowed
the costume.

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:31.040
Don't borrow it.

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:33.460
By the way, Akito,

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:36.420
what's up with Sana-chan's
scandals?

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:39.670
Yes, yes, Dad wanted to ask
about that too.

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:41.010
Dad!

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:45.550
I don't know anything about it.

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:47.430
I see.

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:51.350
But it's mean, this magazine is
saying whatever they want.

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:55.110
Ah, this kind of
trash could just...

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:57.020
What are you doing?!

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:05.820
Suddenly dropping out of
the drama, that's so unlike her...

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:10.410
She's not the type of person who
would be so spoiled.

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:12.750
That's what I think.

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:16.290
Well, she does do weird things for
no apparent reason.

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:19.960
I don't get it!

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:34.560
{parte b}

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:37.020
Christmas Eve Day

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:36.980
Christmas Eve Day!

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:44.450
Naozumi-kun, your role in this
show is different than your past shows.

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:47.740
Yes, and I will try hard to do
my best.

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:51.120
By the way, the last drama that I
did will be premiering today.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:54.120
It's called 'Little Love',
please watch it also.

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:58.420
I heard that France's big director
Richard Bentz

00:12:58.420 --> 00:13:01.590
wants you to play something in his next movie, is that true?

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:03.420
A rumor's a rumor.

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:07.470
But if there is such a thing, then
I definitely wanna do it.

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:11.140
I want to reach my highest
potential as an actor.

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:14.560
He has such good eyes...
so straightforward.

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:19.320
I could bet you money on that.
He will definitely be a good actor.

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:21.070
Who are you?

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:29.870
Naozumi's so cool!

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:34.200
I'm so happy for you! You looked
so great! You looked so serious!

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:36.500
I'm serious about it.

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:42.460
From now on I will really be
getting into my work and honestly do my best.

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:46.930
I'm gonna do my best too!
I'll bring out the best of your abilities.

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:48.590
My best regards to you.

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:53.220
No! Don't be so formal with me!
I mean it's between you and me.

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:54.640
Oh well!

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:56.020
Don't let go of the wheel!

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:58.810
I'll give my best regards to you
too, Naozumi.

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:03.610
Sana-chan, I guess we're going
our separate ways now.

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:07.240
But I still have something
left to do.

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:12.080
Kamura!

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:16.580
Hayama-kun, the real reason Sana-chan wasn't in the drama, do you know?

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:18.290
The real reason?

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:20.670
Please watch today's drama.

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:22.960
Ah? What's that supposed to mean?

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:24.960
If you watch, you'll understand.

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:35.390
You're such a good guy, Naozumi.

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:40.440
Merry Christmas!

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:44.690
Merry Christmas!

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:47.240
Happy Birthday, Fuka!

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:48.780
Congratulations.

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:50.360
Thanks!

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:55.870
Merry Christmas!

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:58.660
So this is the singing and dancing
reindeer set.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:01.080
You're really strange,
Father Hayama.

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:08.130
How romantic...

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:11.340
Alright, then,
I hope you're all happy!

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:15.470
Merry Christmas!

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:19.440
Matches? Matches?

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:24.690
Everyone is having a merry Christmas, but I'm having a lonely Christmas.

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:26.860
Can you give me one box
of matches?

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:29.450
A nice gentlemen!

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:33.950
Would you like to spend the night
at my house, miss?

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:38.200
Oh Christ-sama! I'm so glad that I have
lived my life seriously.

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:41.120
Now let's go, miss!

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:43.380
I have to go back home
and watch the drama!

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:45.000
You know... 'Little Love',

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:47.170
the one Sana-chan was supposed to be in!

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:48.710
You don't know?

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:51.590
It's almost 9 o'clock.

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:54.260
Oh, I'm so full!

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:56.720
That was really good!

00:15:57.760 --> 00:15:58.930
What's wrong?

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:01.600
It's almost 9, what should we do?

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:03.440
Ah, you mean that drama?

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:05.480
Oh yeah, it's today, isn't it?

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:07.480
What, what, what is it?

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:10.280
Santa-san...

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:16.580
Watch today's drama,
and you'll understand.

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:22.000
Christ-sama...

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:25.880
You don't want to hear Dad's song,
do you, Akito?

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:27.420
That's not it.

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:34.930
I think you should be more honest
with your feelings.

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:36.430
Kamura Naozumi.

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:39.010
You don't get it, do you? You...

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:42.430
Who is this girl?
Sana-chan is so much better.

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:46.940
Shut up! You'll never understand
my feelings!

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:52.240
You're a devil!
You'll always be a devil!

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:55.240
Hey! That's...

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:58.280
Completely like the old
Hayama-san, isn't it?

00:16:58.280 --> 00:16:59.490
Sana-chan!

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:00.370
Eh?

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:05.420
She was dropped out of the drama
because she asked for lines to be changed.

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:07.790
Oh yeah, those lines just now...

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:10.880
...would have completely hurt
Hayama-kun.

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:13.340
Hmm? What, what is it, what?

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:17.970
Akito... that drama...

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:22.850
I'll run for a bit.

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:26.850
Go.

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:37.240
She did that for me. Because she
didn't want to hurt my feelings.

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:41.030
So that drama...

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:45.330
Last Christmas she got me
a dinosaur.

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:48.960
But I gave her nothing though.

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:53.590
I thought it's better than
nothing, so I made her a snowman.

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:07.600
This year, so she won't hurt me,
she gave up her precious work.

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:11.320
This year I didn't
do anything for her.

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:14.530
Nothing... for her.

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:21.200
It keeps on falling.
It's like last year.

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:28.170
Last year everyone was here.

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:30.040
Hayama was here.

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:36.340
Sometimes, it feels so nice being
in cold weather.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:06.750
Hayama?

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:16.800
Kurata.

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:24.600
I saw the drama.

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:27.180
I see.

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:29.140
I...

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:32.520
I'm always saved by you.

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:41.530
That's not true.
That's not true at all.

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:49.200
You have taken care of me too...
many many times...

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:57.050
That's...

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:58.840
a snowman, isn't it?

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:00.090
Yeah.

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:02.180
For me?

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:03.720
Yeah.

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:06.720
You're gonna give it to me, right?

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:08.060
Yeah...

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:10.850
I am.

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:12.480
Thank you!

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:14.400
Kurata.

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:20.740
I love Hayama after all.

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:26.780
I'm not gonna regret it again.
I have to tell her my feelings clearly.

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:31.500
I have to say it, I have to tell
him my feelings. I can do it now.

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:36.630
- I lov...
- I lov...

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:39.920
Ah! Sana-chan and Akito-kun!

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:45.720
Why is everyone here?

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:50.020
We had a party at my house, and
we're taking Aya and Hisae back to their homes.

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:51.680
Sana-chan,
why are you guys here?

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:53.850
Ah? Could it be a date?

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:54.810
No!

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:57.520
It's a coincidence! We just met!

00:20:57.520 --> 00:21:00.480
But weren't you guys gazing
at each other?

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:02.070
Ummm... that was...

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:05.360
Her nose was dripping
so I thought I'd wipe it.

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:09.450
Hey hey hey, you're
talking to a lady like that?

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:12.750
Your nose really is dripping.

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:16.960
So you're talking about that.

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:20.960
So that's what you get!

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:25.760
Don't you dare!

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.350
That looks like fun, doesn't it?

00:21:31.350 --> 00:21:32.770
We should join in too.

00:21:32.770 --> 00:21:33.850
I agree!

00:21:53.620 --> 00:21:55.580
It's your turn, Mama.

00:21:56.370 --> 00:21:58.000
Oh, I almost forgot.

00:21:58.000 --> 00:21:59.080
Huh?

00:21:59.210 --> 00:22:01.170
A letter came for you.

00:22:01.630 --> 00:22:03.000
Really?

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:09.090
A message from Takaishi-kun!

00:22:10.800 --> 00:22:13.720
Merry Christmas you know, Fuka!

00:22:16.560 --> 00:22:20.190
Merry Christmas you know,
Takaishi-kun.

